[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふむふむ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, let's see..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ロロナ先輩、何してるんですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What are you doing, Rorona?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、二人とも！\n実は、ユナちゃんに密着取材中なの！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, you two! I'm actually shadowing Juna right now!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "密着取材？\u3000あ、もしかして応援演説のためにですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Shadowing? Wait, is this for the campaign speech?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういうことらしい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That seems to be the idea."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "改めて、ユナちゃんのいいところを\n見つけようと思って！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wanted to find all of Juna's good qualities!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "理由は分かりましたけど、動きが怪しすぎます……。\nもうちょっと周りの目を気にしたほうがいいと思います",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I understand your reasoning, but you look incredibly suspicious... You might want to be a bit more discreet."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え、そう！？\u3000き、気を付けるよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh, really?! I-I'll be careful."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もう授業が始まる。行くぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Class is about to start. Let's go."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はーい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Coming!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、このレシピで使用する中和剤に\n必要な成分はなんでしょう？\u3000はい、ユナ。書いて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So what ingredients are needed for the neutralizing agent in this recipe? Yes, Juna. Write it down."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……できました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Done."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい、正解",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Correct."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おおー！\u3000さすが！\u3000勉強は完璧だね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Woooow! Amazing! Your studies are perfect!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "食べ方も綺麗……食事マナーも完璧！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And you eat so elegantly... Perfect table manners too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……よし、完成だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...There, it's complete."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術の腕も完璧……やっぱりすごいなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your alchemy skills are perfect too... You really are incredible!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ロロナ先輩、密着取材の様子はどうですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How's the shadowing going, Rorona?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "順調だよ。ユナちゃんのいいところ、\nたくさん見つけられたし！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Great! I've found lots of good things about Juna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう改めて言われると気恥ずかしいな……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's a bit embarrassing when you put it like that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "応援演説、考えられそうですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Do you think you can come up with a good campaign speech?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うーん、どうだろ。ユナちゃんのここがすごい！\nっていうのは言えるけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, I'm not sure. I can definitely talk about how amazing Juna is, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もちろん、それだけではダメです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course, that alone won't be enough."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひゃあっ！？\u3000プラフタちゃん、いつの間に……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Eeeek!? Plachta, when did you get here...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "立候補者の人柄をアピールすることも必要ですが、\nそれが生徒会長としてどう活かせるのかも重要です",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "While it's important to highlight a candidate's character, you must also explain how those qualities will serve them as student council president."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "立候補者の公約と照らし合わせて、\n論理立てて説明することで説得力が増します",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "By connecting these traits to the candidate's platform and providing logical explanations, your speech will become more persuasive."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うう～、そういうの苦手……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Uuugh, I'm not good at that sort of thing..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこは私の問題でもあるな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's my problem too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ユナ。新しい公約、拝見しました。\n最初よりは良くなったと思いますよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna, I've seen your new platform. It's improved since your first draft."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そうか、ありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I see. Thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "応援演説のこともありますし、\n今一度、公約について深掘りしてみましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Given the upcoming campaign speech, let's take another look at your platform and explore it more deeply."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]